# since. @session-dock-awaiting hides the mark, @session-dock-awaiting-blink
# limits the blink, @session-dock-awaiting-after sets how long a stop must last
# before it is worth reporting. All three are re-read once a second.
SIDEBAR_AWAITING_ENABLED="${TMUX_SESSION_SIDEBAR_AWAITING_ENABLED:-true}"
SIDEBAR_AWAITING_AFTER_MS="${TMUX_SESSION_SIDEBAR_AWAITING_AFTER_MS:-30000}"
